TO: Royal Highnesses / House of Chiefs / Barotse Royal Establishment
FROM: Major Dr. Kabanga Allan

RE: Request for Cultural Endorsement – National Languages (Official Status) Bill 2025

To Their Royal Highnesses,

With the utmost respect, I submit the National Languages (Official Status) Bill, 2025 for your cultural consideration and endorsement. The bill elevates Bemba and Lozi as official languages within the governance and legal frameworks of Zambia, restoring historical dignity and constitutional relevance.

Your blessing and support are vital to this mission.

Sincerely,
Major Dr. Kabanga Allan
